    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<h2>Find Your Way to Highway 90 Cannabis Dispensary in Marlton, NJ</h2><p>Conveniently located in Marlton, New Jersey, just minutes from Cherry Hill, Mount Laurel, and Philadelphia, Highway 90 Cannabis Dispensary is your go-to destination for premium cannabis in South Jersey. Situated at 90 Old Marlton Pike, our dispensary offers a welcoming, customer-focused experience backed by a curated <a href=\"/menu/\">menu</a> of high-quality cannabis products and <a href=\"/brands/\">brands</a>, including fresh <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vape</a> cartridges, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, and wellness-focused CBD options. Whether you’re a local resident, visiting the area, or just searching for the best dispensary near me, look no further than Highway 90. We’re easy to reach and committed to providing expert guidance and top-tier products for every cannabis journey.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "group",
   "id": "17685dd",
   "children": [
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<h3>Directions from Nearby Cities &amp; Highways</h3><h4>From Philadelphia, PA (via Route 70 East):</h4><ul><li><p>Cross the <strong>Ben Franklin Bridge</strong> and continue onto <strong>Route 30 East</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Merge onto <strong>Route 70 East</strong> toward Cherry Hill.</p></li><li><p>Continue for about 10 miles.</p></li><li><p>Turn right onto <strong>Old Marlton Pike</strong>—you’ll find us just ahead at <strong>90 Old Marlton Pike</strong>, on the right.</p></li></ul><h4>From Cherry Hill, NJ:</h4><ul><li><p>Head east on <strong>Route 70</strong> toward Marlton.</p></li><li><p>After passing <strong>Springdale Road</strong>, continue straight for about 5 miles.</p></li><li><p>Take the exit for <strong>Old Marlton Pike</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Our dispensary is located just off the ramp, at <strong>90 Old Marlton Pike</strong>.</p></li></ul><h4>From Mount Laurel or I-295:</h4><ul><li><p>Take <strong>I-295</strong> to <strong>Exit 34A</strong> for <strong>Route 70 East</strong> toward Marlton.</p></li><li><p>Continue for about 3 miles.</p></li><li><p>Turn right onto <strong>Old Marlton Pike</strong>—Highway 90 is just down the road.</p></li></ul><h4>From Medford, NJ:</h4><ul><li><p>Take <strong>NJ-70 West</strong> toward Marlton.</p></li><li><p>Turn left onto <strong>Cropwell Road</strong>, then right onto <strong>Old Marlton Pike</strong>.</p></li><li><p>We’re located at <strong>90 Old Marlton Pike</strong>, with easy parking and a welcoming storefront.</p></li></ul><h3>Parking &amp; Accessibility</h3><p>We offer ample on-site parking and a fully accessible entrance for all customers.</p>"
    }
   ]
